command: python3 -I -B <work>/stplant.py <the edit output> <the planted copy> MODE, for MODE nostyle, before and kept, each copy in its own run directory <work>/c-st-nostyle, <work>/c-st-before and <work>/c-st-kept; stcheck.py over each; the program:
    """Writes a copy of an output with one planted change: "nostyle" removes
    the c:style of val 26 from every chart part, "before" moves it before
    roundedCorners, "kept" changes xl/charts/chart1.xml's c14:style val 102 to
    103."""
    import sys
    import zipfile
    
    sys.dont_write_bytecode = True
    src, dst, mode = sys.argv[1:4]
    STYLE = b'<c:style val="26"/>'
    CORNERS = b'<c:roundedCorners val="0"/>'
    with zipfile.ZipFile(src) as a, zipfile.ZipFile(dst, "w", zipfile.ZIP_DEFLATED) as b:
        for info in a.infolist():
            data = a.read(info.filename)
            if info.filename.startswith("xl/charts/chart"):
                if mode == "nostyle":
                    data = data.replace(STYLE, b"")
                elif mode == "before":
                    data = data.replace(CORNERS + STYLE, STYLE + CORNERS)
                elif mode == "kept" and info.filename == "xl/charts/chart1.xml":
                    data = data.replace(b'<c14:style val="102"/>', b'<c14:style val="103"/>')
            b.writestr(info, data)
